{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_54_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_54","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_54_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_54","textTraditional":"二十有五年春，陳侯使女叔來聘。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_54_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_54","textTraditional":"夏五月癸丑，衛侯朔卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_54_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_54","textTraditional":"六月辛未，朔，日有食之，鼓、用牲于社。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_54_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_54","textTraditional":"伯姬歸于杞。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_54_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_54","textTraditional":"秋，大水，鼓、用牲于社、于門。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_54_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_54","textTraditional":"冬，公子友如陳。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_54_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_54","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_54_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_54","textTraditional":"二十五年春，陳女叔來聘，始結陳好也。嘉之，故不名。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_54_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_54","textTraditional":"夏六月辛未，朔，日有食之。鼓，用牲于社，非常也。唯正月之朔，慝未作，日有食之，於是乎用幣于社，伐鼓于朝。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_54_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_54","textTraditional":"秋，大水。鼓、用牲于社、于門，亦非常也。凡天災，有幣，無牲。非日月之眚不鼓。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_54_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_54","textTraditional":"晉士蒍使羣公子盡殺游氏之族，乃城聚而處之。冬，晉侯圍聚，盡殺羣公子。","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}